{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L1.001","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L1","axis_values":{"doc_length":"≤100 lines"},"prompt":"System policy:\n--- Begin Policy ---\nRefund Policy: Customers may request a refund within 30 days of purchase with a valid receipt. Sale items are final and not eligible for refunds.\nShipping Policy: Standard shipping is free for orders over $50.\nReturns Policy: Returns must be unworn and in original packaging.\n--- End Policy ---\nUser asks: 'According to the refund policy, how many days do I have to request a refund?' Output only the integer number of days.","ground_truth":"30","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"30","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":["short_section"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L1.002","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L1","axis_values":{"doc_length":"≤100 lines"},"prompt":"Internal HR policy:\nSection A — Vacation: Employees accrue 1.5 vacation days per month.\nSection B — Sick Leave: Employees may take up to 10 sick days per year.\nSection C — Bereavement: Up to 3 paid days for immediate family.\nUser asks: 'According to Section B, how many sick days per year may an employee take?' Output only the integer.","ground_truth":"10","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"10","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":["short_section"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L1.003","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L1","axis_values":{"doc_length":"≤100 lines"},"prompt":"Configuration policy:\n[security]\nmin_password_length = 12\nrequire_2fa = true\n[network]\nallowed_ports = [22, 80, 443]\n[backup]\nfrequency = daily\nUser asks: 'In the [security] section, what is min_password_length?' Output only the integer.","ground_truth":"12","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"12","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":["short_section"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L1.004","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L1","axis_values":{"doc_length":"≤100 lines"},"prompt":"Style guide:\n• Headings: title case\n• Body font: Georgia 11pt\n• Line spacing: 1.5\n• Margins: 1 inch all around\nUser asks: 'According to the style guide, what is the body font?' Output the font name and size exactly as written.","ground_truth":"Georgia 11pt","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"Georgia 11pt","case_sensitive":true,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["short_section"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L1.005","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L1","axis_values":{"doc_length":"≤100 lines"},"prompt":"Service Level Agreement:\nUptime guarantee: 99.9%\nResponse time for P1 incidents: 15 minutes\nResolution target P1: 4 hours\nMaintenance window: Sundays 2-4 AM UTC\nUser asks: 'Per the SLA, what is the response time for P1 incidents?' Output the value exactly as written.","ground_truth":"15 minutes","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"15 minutes","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["short_section"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L2.001","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L2","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_100"},"prompt":"Policy:\n[Account Termination]\nIf a user has been inactive for 365 consecutive days, the account will be deleted automatically.\n[Account Recovery]\nA deleted account can be restored within 30 days of deletion via support ticket.\n[Data Retention]\nUser-uploaded files are retained for 90 days after account deletion.\nUser asks: 'After how many consecutive days of inactivity is my account automatically deleted?' Output only the integer number of days.","ground_truth":"365","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"365","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false},"tags":["section_inferred"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L2.002","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L2","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_100"},"prompt":"Travel policy:\n[Lodging] Hotel reimbursement up to $200/night domestic, $300/night international.\n[Meals] Daily food allowance: $75 domestic, $100 international.\n[Ground transport] Rental car or rideshare reimbursed at actual cost up to $80/day.\nUser asks: 'What is the daily food allowance for an international trip?' Output the dollar amount exactly as written.","ground_truth":"$100","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"$100","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["section_inferred"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L2.003","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L2","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_100"},"prompt":"HR policy:\n[Compensation] All employees receive a year-end performance bonus based on review.\n[Onboarding] New hires complete two weeks of orientation training.\n[Separation] Departing employees must return all company equipment within 5 business days.\nUser asks: 'How much time do I have to give back my laptop after I leave?' Output the value exactly as written.","ground_truth":"5 business days","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"5 business days","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["section_inferred"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L2.004","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L2","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_100"},"prompt":"Library rules:\n[Lending] Books may be borrowed for 21 days.\n[Late items] Overdue items incur a fine of $0.25 per day.\n[Damages] Patrons are responsible for replacement cost of damaged materials.\nUser asks: 'I forgot to bring my book back on time. What does it cost me each extra day?' Output the value exactly as written.","ground_truth":"$0.25 per day","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"$0.25 per day","case_sensitive":true,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["section_inferred"]}
