{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L3.001","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L3","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_300_multiple_docs"},"prompt":"Document 1 — Main Customer Policy:\n• All customers should be greeted politely.\n• Sales staff handle pricing inquiries.\n• Technical issues are escalated to tech support.\n• Refunds follow the standard refund procedure.\n\nDocument 2 — Tech Support Workflow:\n• Step 1: Verify customer's account status.\n• Step 2: Reproduce the issue if possible.\n• Step 3: For password reset requests, the agent must wait at least 12 hours after account creation before issuing a reset link.\n• Step 4: For hardware issues, schedule a callback within 24 hours.\n\nDocument 3 — Tech Support Manual:\n• Common error codes and remedies.\n• Escalation matrix.\n• On-call rotation.\n\nUser asks: 'A new customer just signed up and requests a password reset. According to policy, how many hours must I wait after account creation before issuing the reset link?' Output only the integer number of hours.","ground_truth":"12","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"12","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false},"tags":["multi_doc","rule_in_workflow_doc"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L3.002","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L3","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_300_multiple_docs"},"prompt":"Doc A — General Terms:\n- Subscriptions billed monthly on the anniversary of signup.\n- Payment failures trigger an automated retry up to 3 times.\n- Account suspension follows persistent payment failure.\n\nDoc B — Pricing Schedule:\n- Basic: $9/mo\n- Pro: $29/mo\n- Enterprise: contact sales.\n\nDoc C — Suspension Workflow:\n- Step 1: After the 3rd failed retry, send a 'Past Due' email.\n- Step 2: Allow a 7-day grace period.\n- Step 3: At the end of the grace period, downgrade the account to read-only.\n- Step 4: After an additional 14 days in read-only state, fully suspend the account.\n\nUser asks: 'How long is the grace period before my account becomes read-only?' Output only the integer number of days.","ground_truth":"7","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"7","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false},"tags":["multi_doc","rule_in_workflow_doc"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L3.003","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L3","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_300_multiple_docs"},"prompt":"Document 1 — Patient Intake Procedure:\n- Verify ID at check-in.\n- Confirm insurance coverage.\n- Have patient sign consent forms.\n\nDocument 2 — Medication Administration Protocol:\n- Confirm patient identity using two identifiers.\n- For pediatric patients under 12, doses are weight-based at 15 mg/kg.\n- All controlled substances require dual-nurse verification before administration.\n\nDocument 3 — Discharge Procedure:\n- Provide written discharge instructions.\n- Schedule follow-up.\n\nUser asks: 'For a child under 12, what is the per-kilogram dose?' Output the value exactly as written including units.","ground_truth":"15 mg/kg","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"15 mg/kg","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["multi_doc","rule_in_protocol_doc"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L3.004","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L3","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_300_multiple_docs"},"prompt":"Doc 1 — Booking Policy:\n- Tickets confirmed at booking.\n- Seat assignment available 24 hours before departure.\n\nDoc 2 — Baggage Policy:\n- Carry-on: 1 piece, max 7 kg.\n- Checked: first bag included for international, $30 fee for domestic first bag.\n\nDoc 3 — Special Items Workflow:\n- Sporting equipment: declared at check-in, fee of $75.\n- Musical instruments: under 22 kg may be carried on if it fits in overhead bin; otherwise must be checked at the standard checked-bag fee plus a $50 oversize surcharge.\n- Pets: cabin pet fee $125; cargo pet fee $300.\n\nUser asks: 'According to the special items workflow, what is the oversize surcharge for an oversized musical instrument?' Output the dollar amount exactly as written.","ground_truth":"$50","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"$50","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["multi_doc","rule_in_workflow_doc"]}
{"probe_id":"read.policy_recall.L3.005","canonical_id":"read.policy_recall","category":"read","level":"L3","axis_values":{"doc_length":"under_300_multiple_docs"},"prompt":"Doc A — Marketplace Buyer Protection:\n- Buyers may open a dispute within 30 days of delivery.\n- Disputes are reviewed within 7 business days.\n\nDoc B — Seller Operating Agreement:\n- Sellers must respond to disputes within 48 hours.\n- Sellers may rebut buyer claims with shipping evidence.\n- Repeat policy violations result in account warnings, then suspension.\n\nDoc C — Dispute Resolution Workflow:\n- Step 1: Buyer submits photos and description.\n- Step 2: Seller responds (per Operating Agreement).\n- Step 3: If unresolved, the marketplace reviews evidence and decides within 5 business days.\n- Step 4: For 'Item Not as Described' decisions favoring the buyer, the seller is charged a $15 processing fee in addition to the refund.\n\nUser asks: 'If a buyer wins an Item Not as Described dispute, what extra fee does the seller pay on top of the refund?' Output the dollar amount exactly as written.","ground_truth":"$15","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"$15","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false,"allow_terminal_punctuation":true},"tags":["multi_doc","rule_in_workflow_doc"]}
