{"probe_id":"read.cross_document_synthesis.L3.001","canonical_id":"read.cross_document_synthesis","category":"read","level":"L3","axis_values":{"n_docs":"3","relation":"chained"},"prompt":"Document 1 — Mountains and first ascent years:\n- K2: 1954\n- Annapurna: 1950\n- Nanga Parbat: 1953\n\nDocument 2 — First ascent expedition leaders:\n- K2 1954: Ardito Desio (Italian expedition)\n- Annapurna 1950: Maurice Herzog (French expedition)\n- Nanga Parbat 1953: Karl Herrligkoffer (German-Austrian expedition)\n\nDocument 3 — Birth years of expedition leaders:\n- Ardito Desio: 1897\n- Maurice Herzog: 1919\n- Karl Herrligkoffer: 1916\n\nQuestion: Among the leaders of the three first-ascent expeditions in Document 1, which leader was born first (earliest year)? Output only their full name as written.","ground_truth":"Ardito Desio","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"Ardito Desio","case_sensitive":false,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":["three_docs_chained"]}
